{"id":"b0f7663908a1058a","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-hopf-algebra.md","title":"Hopf Algebra","display":"df-hopf-algebra — Hopf Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hopf-algebra","aliases":["58-df-hopf-algebra","Hopf Algebra"],"display":"df-hopf-algebra — Hopf Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-algebra]]","[[58-df-bialgebra]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hopf-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hopf-algebra</span><span>Hopf Algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hopf-algebra — Hopf Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"58-df-algebra\">58-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df38af7e4180f1bc\" href=\"?note=df38af7e4180f1bc\" title=\"58-df-bialgebra\">58-df-bialgebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> (vector space over the explicit field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m: H \\otimes H \\to H\">\\(m: H \\otimes H \\to H\\)</span> (multiplication)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta: H \\to H \\otimes H\">\\(\\Delta: H \\to H \\otimes H\\)</span> (coproduct)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:k\\to H\">\\(\\eta:k\\to H\\)</span> (unit)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S: H \\to H\">\\(S: H \\to H\\)</span> (antipode)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon: H \\to k\">\\(\\varepsilon: H \\to k\\)</span> (counit)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{(h)}h_{(1)}\\otimes h_{(2)}\">\\(\\sum_{(h)}h_{(1)}\\otimes h_{(2)}\\)</span> (Sweedler notation for the finite tensor expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(h)\">\\(\\Delta(h)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (Hopf-algebra predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (bialgebra predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,k)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,H,H)\\land\n\\forall h\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{(h)}m(\\langle S(h_{(1)}),h_{(2)}\\rangle)=\\eta(\\varepsilon(h))\\land\n\\sum_{(h)}m(\\langle h_{(1)},S(h_{(2)})\\rangle)=\\eta(\\varepsilon(h))\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,k)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,H,H)\\land\n\\forall h\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{(h)}m(\\langle S(h_{(1)}),h_{(2)}\\rangle)=\\eta(\\varepsilon(h))\\land\n\\sum_{(h)}m(\\langle h_{(1)},S(h_{(2)})\\rangle)=\\eta(\\varepsilon(h))\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hopf algebra: a bialgebra over the same explicit field with a two-sided convolution inverse of the identity.</li>\n<li>Sweedler notation denotes the tensor expression supplied by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span>; it replaces the former ill-typed composition of the pair-valued multiplication <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:H\\times H\\to H\">\\(m:H\\times H\\to H\\)</span> with tensor maps.</li>\n<li>Quantum group: non-commutative, non-cocommutative Hopf algebra</li>\n<li>Structure: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2\">\\(S^2\\)</span> may not be identity</li>\n<li>Representation: tensor categories with braiding</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kassel, Quantum Groups</li>\n<li>Chari and Pressley, A Guide to Quantum Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bialgebra","status":"resolved","id":"df38af7e4180f1bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bialgebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"m: H \\otimes H \\to H","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta: H \\to H \\otimes H","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:k\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"S: H \\to H","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon: H \\to k","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{(h)}h_{(1)}\\otimes h_{(2)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta(h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hopf\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,S,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\varepsilon,k)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,H,H)\\land\n\\forall h\\in H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\sum_{(h)}m(\\langle S(h_{(1)}),h_{(2)}\\rangle)=\\eta(\\varepsilon(h))\\land\n\\sum_{(h)}m(\\langle h_{(1)},S(h_{(2)})\\rangle)=\\eta(\\varepsilon(h))\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"m:H\\times H\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"S^2","display":false}],"bytes":1720,"backlinks":[{"id":"c404a1963024e8a9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HopfAlg}_S\\subseteq V^7$ (Hopf-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-hopf-algebra]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-647","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-hopf-algebra.md|58-df-hopf-algebra]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["573b416d39297a97","df38af7e4180f1bc","36d7463d215be751"]}